      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/1/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 28 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/1/eng@/~cl_11__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/1/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the word “four” the word “forty”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/1/eng@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/1/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) For the purpose of subsection (1), any person who fails to disclose or omits to give any relevant information, document or evidence, or provides, as true, any information, document or evidence that he knows or has reason to believe to be false or misleading shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding four years or to both.”. Amendment of section 29"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/1/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/1/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 29(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph (gi) the following paragraph: “(gj) prescribing a penalty of a fine not exceeding twenty-five thousand ringgit for the contravention of or failure to comply with any of the provisions of any regulations made under this Act;”. Amendment of section 30"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/1/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
